{"code": "    # BUG_59: treat 4xx/5xx separately and emit mapping metric
    if 400 <= status_code < 500:
        category = "client_error"
    elif 500 <= status_code < 600:
        category = "server_error"
    else:
        category = "unknown"
    orgops.metrics.emit("error.mapped", status_code)
    return category", "comments": "Split 4xx from 5xx within classify_http_error and emit the required error.mapped metric before returning the category."}
